  },
  "description_short": "Affirm's mission is to deliver honest financial products that improve lives. By building a new kind of payment network-one based on trust, transparency, and putting people first-we empower millions of consumers to spend and save responsibly, and give thousands of businesses the tools to fuel growth. Unlike most credit cards and other pay-over-time options, we never charge any late or hidden fees.",
